  "content": "{section: Intro}\n[F#m] (riff x4)\n\n{section: Verso 1}\n[F#m]It's five below in evidence\nThe winded eves and sideways snow\nHis eminence has yet to show\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[F#m]Follow the ageless tide [C#m]\nFollow the angled [E]light\nFollow the strangest [Bm]tribe\n\n[F#m] [C#m] [F#] [C#m] [F#]\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[F#m]It's 6:00 AM. You're waiting for...\nYou've had your feast, you're wanting more\n\n{section: Refrão 2}\n[F#m]Follow the wayward mile [C#m]\nFollow the distant [E]high\nFollow the strangest [Bm]tribe\n\n[F#m] [C#m] [F#] [C#m] [F#m]\n\n{section: Refrão 3}\n[F#m]Follow the ancient stripe [C#m]\nFollow the angels [E]try\nFollow the strangest [Bm]tribe\n\n[F#m] [C#m] [F#] [C#m] [F#] [C#m] [F#] [C#m] [F#]"
